            {
              "chord": "A",
              "text": "moved"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "D",
              "text": "And as I walk through the shadows, your love surrounds "
            },
            {
              "chord": "G",
              "text": "me"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "Bm",
              "text": "There’s nothing to fear now, for I am safe with "
            },
            {
              "chord": "A",
              "text": "you"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "Chorus",
      "lines": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "G",
              "text": "So when I fight, I’ll fight on my "
            },
            {
